SY_TALK("l73Ju18PQmA",[[635,["Today it's a great day for us, for all the","Sahaja Yogis that on this day, I would say"]],[653,["we are late by one day or two days, the Sahasrara","was opened out."]],[671,["It was just a miracle I should say because","I didn't think that I am at a point where"]],[688,["it could be done."]],[693,["So I wanted to wait but some things happened","that made Me think that it has to be open."]],[717,["It was","in such a situation that I felt if I delayed"]],[733,["any more now, it may help these false gurus","to spread their nonsense all over."]],[747,["This is just I should say, is a Sahaj way","of doing things."]],[761,["Now 25 years have passed."]],[766,["You all have gathered during this time, and","we have so many others who are not here, who"]],[774,["have achieved so many things."]],[779,["But perhaps, we are not aware as to what we","have achieved in the real sense of the word."]],[789,["You've got your vibrations."]],[793,["You can feel this All Pervading Power."]],[799,["You are as they say, swimming in the ocean","of joy."]],[805,["You are all enjoying the collectivity, and","that you have transcended many of your limitations."]],[818,["All this has happened to you because it is","your right to have it."]],[825,["I don't take any credit for it."]],[829,["Only thing all the time I've been pointing","it out to you one thing that now, you have"]],[842,["entered into the Kingdom of God, and enjoy","yourself."]],[849,["We have to see around ourselves."]],[853,["The whole nature enjoys itself; doesn't bother,","doesn't bother about anything."]],[860,["They haven't got realization."]],[863,["They haven't felt the Paramachaitanya."]],[867,["But how is it they know that we have to enjoy?"]],[873,["The flowers that come out for a short time","and fade out, but as long as they live,"]],[881,["they're very happy."]],[883,["They don't think of their past or of their","future, but they enjoy the present."]],[890,["And in the present, they enjoy what is - that","they are fragrant"]],[897,["and giving fragrance to others."]],[899,["They're beautiful and they are soothing others."]],[903,["The whole nature is like that."]],[906,["If you look at the birds or anything that","we call as natural is all sort of"]],[916,["in a meditative mood."]],[918,["All these hills, and big, big mountains."]],[925,["They look as if they are witness to whatever","has been happening."]],[933,["Now we have to really first look back what","we have achieved."]],[942,["That is important, because if you're climbing","up on a hill, if you look back,"]],[951,[" you get a shock and you may fall down."]],[955,["So normally people say, never look back."]],[958,["But a person who has earned some treasure,","he again and again goes and counts it and"]],[970,["finds out how much he has got, and every time","he sees that, he enjoys."]],[978,["So to know relatively what we have got and","how we have achieved something will definitely"]],[987,["give you greater strength of mind and richness","of life."]],[997,["The first thing that has happened to you I","would say it is very important is this - that"]],[1005,["you have felt this All Pervading Power."]],[1009,["That shows that you must have been great seekers","of truth, honest, sincere, sensible."]],[1019,["That just coming to My program you felt the","vibrations, and after that you started settling"]],[1032,["down into it."]],[1035,["So many of you have felt it suddenly, and","they were amazed and they were shocked and"]],[1042,["surprised, and they wanted to test whether","it is true or not."]],[1049,["But then you were confident, you found it","that you've got definitely a new dimension"]],[1058,["in your life, and that you are feeling this","All Pervading Power of Divine Love."]],[1068,["I'll take one lecture sufficient to describe","this All Pervading Power."]],[1074,["But what you got out of it is the essence","of it, one has to know, is a complete freedom."]],[1085,["You have achieved your complete freedom."]],[1088,["First of all, the freedom has come to you,","first of all, most important,"]],[1095,["is from your ego."]],[1099,["This wall of ego you have crossed."]],[1104,["You have got out of the bondage of this ego,","which was really so much full of"]],[1117,["problems for you."]],[1119,["So many things this ego does of which you","are not aware."]],[1125,["Firstly, a person who is egoist doesn't mind","hurting anyone."]],[1133,["He hurts, but if he's hurt, he doesn't like","it."]],[1138,["Immediately start crying."]],[1139,["Specially I've seen people who have too much","ego are very easily hurt, but they don't understand"]],[1147,["how many people they have hurt already, and","how many are really frightened of such a person."]],[1160,["So you got rid of your ego."]],[1164,["It is sinful to hurt any other human being","for anything; for whatever may be the reason"]],[1172,["that you feel you should hurt another one."]],[1176,["The first is the revenge; the idea of revenge","is there, that I must take a revenge on the"]],[1183,["person who has hurt me or has done some wrong","to me or something of that kind."]],[1194,["This idea of revenge comes when you react."]],[1198,["Some react very violently."]],[1201,["I have seen people murdering each other in","the name of revenge, killing their own kith"]],[1210,["and kin, killing their fellow men, their country","men, all over the world is some sort of a"]],[1217,["stupid idea of revenge."]],[1222,["But if you go to the subtle side of revenge,","what is it?"]],[1228,["What revenge have you taken?"]],[1230,["Supposing there is somebody who has troubled","you."]],[1233,["You are angry with that person and you have","killed that person, so you have actually"]],[1237,["saved him."]],[1240,["He won't have to suffer from guilty conscience,","it won't have to do anything, it's just finished."]],[1247,["What is the revenge is?"]],[1250,["The revenge should be only by which a person","gets out of his idea of killing others."]],[1260,["Like a sword never fights a sword, it fights","the shield."]],[1265,["In the same way, the revenge that we think","we can take on another person is not a revenge,"]],[1278,["because any action you take in the name of","revenge comes back to you"]],[1285,["and hurts you much more."]],[1288,["So many things can happen if a person in the","name of revenge starts acting."]],[1294,["Now for example, these days you know in the","whole world,"]],[1297,[" there's so much of revenge going on,"]],[1300,["even in the name of God; taking revenge","because certain people are following some"]],[1309,["religion, or they are doing something else","that you are doing."]],[1314,["Working out this kind of a revenge, what has","happening is that you are just killing people,"]],[1322,["destroying them, who do not even understand","what sort of a revenge you are taking."]],[1329,["People are putting bombs and putting all kinds","of things and by that thousands of innocent"]],[1335,["people one is killing; so what kind of a revenge","have you taken?"]],[1341,["They don't deserve any revenge."]],[1344,["So this revenge when it explodes can destroy","so many innocent people and it will definitely"]],[1352,["react on you."]],[1354,["You cannot get away with it."]],[1357,["It's a very long process of this revenge."]],[1365,["I've told you about Bermuda Triangle what","they say, that so many blacks were taken slaves"]],[1374,["and were drowned in that area, so their spirits","they are saying, are haunting on the people"]],[1381,["who are passing by; mostly the whites and","they just drowned."]],[1387,["So it's a very long process, and all that","I need not discuss at this auspicious occasion,"]],[1393,["but I have to say that when we take a revenge,","every action has a reaction."]],[1400,["So somehow you have got out of that idea of","revenge, just out of that idea."]],[1409,["There's another thing that if you don't take","revenge, and leave it to God, It acts."]],[1418,["It acts, not only that, but a Divine Power","takes into Its own control how to really give"]],[1429,["a good lesson to that person or to that community","or to that kind of organization which is taking"]],[1438,["a revenge on you."]],[1441,["You don't have to worry."]],[1446,["I'll have to tell you that in this 25 years","I've seen,"]],[1450,[" people have been extremely unkind to me."]],[1453,["Many organizations, many so called religions,","and all kinds of things have been after us."]],[1460,["Media has been after us."]],[1462,["Take the example of French media."]],[1465,["They tried to trouble us so much and tried","to bring bad name to us, doesn't matter."]],[1474,["The media people now, three of them who went","to India, are now under warrant and if they"]],[1482,["go to India, they will be arrested."]],[1486,["I didn't do anything."]],[1488,["We didn't do anything."]],[1490,["Secondly, the same media, I mean the same","newspapers are all bankrupt."]],[1500,["You didn't do anything about it."]],[1502,["You didn't go and say that they should become","bankrupt."]],[1504,["You didn't take any revenge."]],[1506,["Why should we?"]],[1507,["Why should we take any revenge?"]],[1509,["Because we are not bothered as to what happens;","we are not bothered as to what these people"]],[1517,["have done to us."]],[1519,["But legally they are now involved in such","a way that they are under warrant and if they"]],[1527,["go to India, they'll be arrested."]],[1530,["And the whole of French government is with","them, all of them are trying so much, but"]],[1537,["this punishment is on their head."]],[1541,["In their lifetime, they didn't have to die","or anything;"]],[1545,[" in their lifetime they have got it."]],[1548,["So you have got this special power that you","don't have to take revenge or you have to"]],[1556,["just forgive."]],[1558,["Just forgive and the forgiveness will look","after the whole arrangement of how to bring"]],[1567,["the other person to its proper path."]],[1573,["So once you are out of this idea of revenge,","you really feel very peaceful, extremely peaceful"]],[1583,["because this peace that you have within yourself","is not unnatural, it's not mental, but its"]],[1590,["just happens to you."]],[1591,["It's all right."]],[1592,["So what if they have said, they have done","anything wrong to us?"]],[1596,["Why should we bother?"]],[1598,["So many things are there which I can tell","you have worked out automatically."]],[1606,["Now in Turkey they told Me that there is some","boy who is from England and he went and told"]],[1615,["the media something against Sahaja Yoga and","it was all published."]],[1620,["But in the court he confessed that, \"Whatever","I said was wrong.\""]],[1626,["Nobody went and told him, nobody threatened","him, nothing happened."]],[1630,["So from your point of view you must understand,","that you're not going to get into any mess"]],[1638,["of taking revenge of any kind, because you","belong to the Government of God."]],[1645,["And this Government is extremely alert, very","genuine and also extremely efficient."]],[1655,["And as far as you are concerned, you are a","citizen of that Great Kingdom."]],[1663,["So what you have achieved is the citizenship","of this great Kingdom of God where you should"]],[1670,["feel absolutely secured."]],[1673,["The man who is secure is never afraid, never","afraid."]],[1679,["So you have also got rid of your fear."]],[1684,["Man is in the - I don't know why he's afraid","of this and afraid of that, and worries about"]],[1691,["this and worries about that."]],[1694,["It's something surprising how they worry about","their health, worry about their family, their"]],[1702,["children, their house, I mean all sorts of","things."]],[1707,["But Sahaja Yogis don't, they don't."]],[1712,["We have no worry."]],[1713,["It all works out."]],[1715,["Why should we worry?"]],[1717,["That instrument of worry is over."]],[1720,["It's finished; I think it's gone out of order."]],[1723,["And what you are now in a state where you","just have no time to worry, because you are"]],[1733,["enjoying yourself."]],[1735,["This fear I have seen in people works so much","that so many diseases people get out of fear,"]],[1746,["so many diseases, specially most of these","left sided diseases people get out of fear."]],[1752,["What is there to fear?"]],[1755,["This is like you beat the Mother Earth saying","that there's a snake."]],[1761,["There's no snake, but you may just feel that","way and you may go on with this fear."]],[1766,["Anybody, any kind of a idea about a phantom","or someone or some sort of a big devil standing"]],[1777,["somewhere; it is all nonsense."]],[1781,["For you, it doesn't exist."]],[1784,["Say in the darkness you are walking so you","see forms and things and some people say I"]],[1790,["saw one on a tree, one some sort of a form;","it doesn't exist actually, it doesn't exist."]],[1796,["But this fear in man makes him think like","that."]],[1800,["He's afraid of this and afraid of that, and","then as a result, he loses his freedom."]],[1806,["He becomes slave, slave to so many people","he's afraid of - that such and such man will"]],[1814,["harm me, such and such man will trouble Me,","and the whole concept of fear has ruined our"]],[1823,["family lives."]],[1825,["For example, a wife is dominating, husband","is dominating, there's nothing to fear, nothing"]],[1833,["to fear."]],[1833,["By fear only you play into their hands."]],[1837,["So supposing the wife is dominating, just","make fun out of it."]],[1842,["If you cannot make the fun in the presence","of say your wife or your husband, better make"]],[1848,["it outside."]],[1849,["Take it, \"Oh look at that.\""]],[1851,["It is your special quality now that you can","really get rid of your fear completely."]],[1861,["What is there to be afraid of wife or afraid","of husband?"]],[1864,["What can he do to you?"]],[1866,["At the most he'll kill you, so what, you are","going to die in anyway."]],[1874,["So the fear of death is another nonsense people","have."]],[1878,["First time when I started My work everywhere","they asked Me, \"What about death?\""]],[1886,["I said, but just now you are living; why are","you asking, \"What about death?\""]],[1890,["So many people ask Me question, \"What about","our death\";"]],[1893,[" with why do you want to know about it?"]],[1895,["I'll tell you what about today, just now."]],[1898,["So this is another mad idea - that we should","know about our death, what's going to happen,"]],[1906,["and whatever happens."]],[1908,["Once you are dead you are finished."]],[1910,["You don't have to do anything after that."]],[1912,["So what's the use of knowing when, when you","will die, what will happen to you?"]],[1918,["Whatever has to happen will happen."]],[1920,["We never ask, that when I sleep what will","happen to me, do we?"]],[1923,["And this is a permanent sleep and we worry","so much about it that we should know what"]],[1929,["will happen after death."]],[1931,["One has to die at the time whenever it has","to die, because whatever is born has to be"]],[1937,["dead."]],[1939,["But you do know that you have got eternal","life."]],[1947,["You can never die."]],[1949,["Death is not this body disappearing; death","is where you are absolutely without any control"]],[1962,["of your soul live."]],[1964,["Once you are a realized soul you have all","the control, all the powers: to take your"]],[1974,["soul wherever you feel like, to be born if","you like; if you don't want you will not be"]],[1980,["born, to be born with the people in the families,","in the communities wherever you like."]],[1988,["There are many great souls I know that have","taken birth daringly into societies which"]],[1995,["are very much, I should say, deteriorating","and are in danger of getting destroyed because"]],[2003,["of stupidity they do."]],[2006,["So this happening, that we are afraid of death,","is absolutely absurd for Sahaja Yogis."]],[2020,["What is there to think even about your death?"]],[2024,["There is nothing like death for you because","you have got eternal life."]],[2032,["It's not that you continue with the same body."]],[2036,["You may go on changing your dress but you","are living, you are aware, and you know even"]],[2042,["if this body is not there-you will be there;","all the time, available for Sahaja Yoga, for"]],[2050,["anything that is to be done in the name of","reality."]],[2056,["So you must know your position as eternal","being what is your work, what is your idea,"]],[2069,["what you have to do."]],[2070,["So one has to get rid of this idea of death","because death doesn't exist for you."]],[2079,["It's finished."]],[2081,["Moreover, all such people who are afraid of","their death go on having insurances, this,"]],[2089,["that, all headaches, see, and ultimately what","happens?"]],[2095,["All these worldly things you leave here and","you depart."]],[2100,["There is I don't think anybody could carry","even a little dust with that soul"]],[2111,["which is departing."]],[2113,["But in your case, when you people are no more","on this earth so called, then you don't carry"]],[2122,["all this material things because you have","already given up."]],[2124,["You have no interest in them."]],[2127,["You're not materialistic so your spirit is","free, and when you die what happens to you"]],[2137,["is a very simple thing - that you feel very","liberated, absolutely."]],[2144,["And then you feel your freedom completely,","and you can decide what you want to do."]],[2152,["It's all under your own guidance, your own","desire; everything works out."]],[2159,["You don't feel that you have come out of your","body, and this is what should tell you that"]],[2167,["there should be no fear of death, but on the","contrary - it should be welcomed."]],[2174,["Because you will feel much more liberated,","much more at ease."]],[2182,["You don't have other problems that you have","to in any case carry on in this world so because"]],[2188,["of this body."]],[2190,["Now see I have to take some medicines, I have","to take vitamins; don't have to take anything,"]],[2196,["don't need it."]],[2198,["This body's finished is a very good idea."]],[2203,["They're so troublesome it is you see."]],[2207,["All the time despite the fact that you may","say that, \"Oh I don't care for this body,\""]],[2210,["and all that, but this body won't leave you."]],[2214,["This is the most sticky thing we have is our","body."]],[2222,["So to forget about death should be the easiest","thing for you."]],[2231,["We have broken many walls."]],[2235,["As you know very well that the conditionings","we had, we have finished that."]],[2246,["It's very surprising."]],[2247,["I've seen people when they get their realization,","immediately after that"]],[2252,["they start seeing around them."]],[2254,["They'll immediately tell you what's wrong","with their religion, then they'll tell you"]],[2261,["what's wrong with their country; what's wrong","with their culture."]],[2266,["It's through them I have come to know so much."]],[2269,["I didn't know that this was so, but they themselves","told us."]],[2272,["Now for example there's a French man, take","it - if a Frenchman gets realization, I mean"]],[2279,["you know everything about French."]],[2282,["The things you could never even imagine what","sort of people they are; they will tell you"]],[2287,["everything."]],[2288,["Same with the English I've seen."]],[2291,["English they may, they laugh at themselves","all right, but actually when they become realized"]],[2298,["souls you see, they give you a complete picture","of English people: what sort of people are"]],[2304,["there, what's wrong with them, how they are","egoistical, this, that."]],[2308,["I was amazed."]],[2309,["I mean, I, I, I never knew so many things","which I came to know through Sahaja Yogis"]],[2314,["who got realization."]],[2316,["Because they have seen all these things very","thoroughly and very closely and they knew"]],[2321,["what was it."]],[2325,["Now when you become so cleaned, washed out","completely, mind completely cleaned out from"]],[2336,["all kinds of conditionings you see; you become","like a mirror, beautiful mirror."]],[2346,["And in that mirror one can see complete picture","of the society in which you live, the complete"]],[2353,["picture of the government which rules you;","everything, so clear-cut."]],[2358,["And it is absolute."]],[2360,["It is not biased."]],[2362,["For example you ask somebody, then he will","say, \"What is your politics?\""]],[2367,["If I say My politics is I have no politics,","say, \"What you have no politics, how can we"]],[2372,["exist without politics?\""]],[2374,["I have no politics."]],[2376,["So they will go on asking questions to you","which are very much unknown."]],[2385,["But for a realized soul, it's just the other","way round."]],[2389,["Hes not only sees, but also shows and expresses,","very clearly."]],[2398,["I've been amazed at the way people have been","really so reflective of the society into which"]],[2408,["they live and the country which they represent."]],[2413,["So the identification is lost, complete identification","is lost."]],[2418,["You don't feel identified much."]],[2420,["You just see what's wrong with that world."]],[2422,["Then also another point is that you start","seeing how you can help, what you should do,"]],[2430,["how you can work it out."]],[2433,["And the importance of that becomes your main","thing in life."]],[2439,["Everybody I see, yesterday the way you brought","all this flags and all that, behind that flag,"]],[2444,["I could see, all of you wanted that peace","should prevail in those countries, they should"]],[2451,["get all the joy and beauty of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2455,["It's what a feeling it is."]],[2457,["It's not like yourself becoming Sahaja Yogis","and sitting in the corner, no."]],[2462,["They want to do it for that country about","which they are not identified, but without"]],[2470,["identification, they have that deep feeling","that they have to work out; correct it."]],[2477,["It's a very different type of personality","you develop."]],[2482,["Normally you see if you say a word against","somebody that, \"See in your country they do"]],[2488,["like this..\""]],[2489,["\"Oh what you're talking, what about your country?\""]],[2492,["Immediately."]],[2493,["They'll never accept."]],[2495,["If you just try to even say one word against","them, their country or their government, which"]],[2505,["may be the most rotten government, but no","still, \"What?"]],[2509,["We are all right.\""]],[2511,["That kind of stupid identification, which","keeps you completely glued to that society;"]],[2521,["like some people will say, \"No, no, I have","to go to the pub.\""]],[2525,["I say, why?"]],[2527,["Why you have to go to the pub?"]],[2528,["\"That's our society; that's our culture."]],[2530,["We have to go."]],[2531,["We have to go to the pub, get drunk and fall","down, all of us together."]],[2538,["That's the sort of thing we are; we can't","help it you see."]],[2541,["This is what it is.\""]],[2543,["You tell anybody that, why do you do this","like this?"]],[2546,["What is the need to do?"]],[2548,["\"Now, because I have to live in this society,","after all, after all I belong to this society"]],[2554,["and I just can't do what I like.\""]],[2558,["But when you get your realization, you can","do what you like."]],[2561,["You can do what you like, because you only","like that is righteous, that is good, that"]],[2569,["is constructive, that is helpful."]],[2571,["So you can do whatever you like; after realization,","there's no restriction for you."]],[2576,["All these restriction of, \"don't, don't, don't,","don't\" - these clearly enslave you."]],[2581,["I think it very much enslaves you."]],[2585,["But in after realization, you are such a free","bird that nothing can enslave you."]],[2591,["For example, there are many preachers who","preach - you shouldn't drink, you should not"]],[2596,["smoke, this, shouldn't take drugs, you should","do this, you should do that -"]],[2601,["but it doesn't stop."]],[2604,["It doesn't help."]],[2605,["People struggle, try everything, ultimately","they commit suicides, but they can't get rid"]],[2611,["of those habits; while now you are so powerful","that nothing can stick to you."]],[2617,["That's the purity of your character that has","come up; it doesn't allow any nonsensical"]],[2624,["things to stick to you."]],[2626,["I've heard of so many Sahaja Yogis telling","me, how their eyes have steadied down, how"]],[2633,["they have become so righteous, how they have","become so pure and they can't understand."]],[2639,["They said, \"Mother is it Your power, Your","purity You have given us, or it is our purity"]],[2644,["You have awakened?\""]],[2645,["Of course yours."]],[2646,["No doubt."]],[2648,["All these things you have, and you become","aware of it, and thus you get absolutely misidentified"]],[2657,["I should say with all these nonsensical things,","and you don't like it."]],[2662,["You just don't like it."]],[2665,["And you go on criticizing."]],[2666,["I've been to all these countries also before,","and I have met people who are very much identified,"]],[2675,["and diplomatically I was not suppose to say","anything whatsoever that would make them feel"]],[2681,["that they are doing something wrong."]],[2684,["But after Sahaja Yoga, the same people are","telling us and making fun of the whole thing."]],[2690,["For example, I've heard some Sahaja Yogis","talking to each other."]],[2693,["He says, \"You see my country, this is so stupid","thing going on.\""]],[2699,["Another one said, \"Nobody can beat mine; it's","much worse.\""]],[2704,["Is a very common competition among Sahaja","Yogis going on."]],[2716,["So that we have to see how pure we have become,","and in this purity anything that is dirty,"]],[2733,["murky, anything that will spoil this purity;","we don't like it."]],[2741,["We don't like it."]],[2744,["We are washed, cleaned, from inside, and won't","want to take anything like that"]],[2750,["within us anymore."]],[2754,["Then I've seen also, the way people have become","so compassionate."]],[2761,["Is very surprising how they have become compassionate","to each other."]],[2768,["For example, there were two Sahaja Yogis,","they were not very happy with each other,"]],[2776,["not compatible; whatever you say that is."]],[2779,["And I didn't know how to make them feel that,","\"You see the other Sahaja Yogi's all right;"]],[2785,["doesn't matter after all, what is.\""]],[2787,["\"No I don't like this thing in him.\""]],[2789,["And the another one would say, \"I don't like","this thing about him.\""]],[2793,["So it went on: \"I don't like,\" he says, \"I","don't like.\""]],[2798,["I mean they were seeing each other's defects","or whatever you may call them."]],[2805,["So I said, \"All right now will you meditate","for some time?\""]],[2809,["Again, \"Meditate, meditate.\""]],[2813,["And I said, \"Now, do you love me?\""]],[2817,["She said I, one says, \"I love You more than","he loves.\""]],[2823,["I said, \"Is difficult situation.\""]],[2828,["How to make them understand now that you cannot","weigh your love; you cannot make a"]],[2839,["chart out of it."]],[2841,["It is something within yourself, and if you","love somebody then you enjoy it."]],[2849,["I mean you cannot qualify it; you cannot quantify","it."]],[2853,["But this was going on with these two gentlemen","together, and I thought, \"Now what to do?\""]],[2862,["They are very important, and still there's","no understanding between the two."]],[2868,["So the Divine Power took over I think."]],[2872,["One of them fell very sick suddenly, very","sick."]],[2877,["And I had sent word also that, \"You'll be","sick; be careful.\""]],[2883,["But it was I mean they thought that the other","fellow might be trying to be funny or something;"]],[2892,["it was not understood."]],[2893,["He was very sick."]],[2894,["When he fell sick, then this one, the another","one, felt such tremendous love for him."]],[2905,["It's something, nobody can explain, that he","went and sat with that patient for 24 hours,"]],[2916,["and said that, \"If you need any money, I have","got.\""]],[2921,["He paid for wherever he could pay."]],[2927,["So this gentleman also was very sensible,","reasonable person on his own - felt this love,"]],[2936,["this affection, in this hard taskmaster, the","other one - and such understanding"]],[2942,[" grew up within them."]],[2945,["It is I think, is the Divine's Play that they","were brought together, so close and such compassion."]],[2955,["So the force of compassion within you is so","much, it's very subtle; you don't see."]],[2962,["Because on mental level - I was telling them,","arguing, trying to pacify him, pacify him;"]],[2971,["like that was on - it would not work out."]],[2974,["But when this force of compassion started","acting suddenly into one of them, the another"]],[2986,["one saw the compassion, the pure compassion,","and just they became great friends."]],[2998,["So one has to feel the compassion within yourself."]],[3005,["I've seen many a times that there are many","Sahaja Yogis and sometimes I have to correct"]],[3015,["them, or say something."]],[3017,["Immediately, another one will say, \"Mother","can You forgive him, You can't forgive?\""]],[3023,["I say I have forgiven."]],[3024,["I am not doing anything."]],[3027,["\"Please forgive, please.\""]],[3030,["I feel so happy to hear that, that in one","point, in one condition, when it comes to"]],[3042,["Sahaja Yogi, you support him, even against","Me; I feel happy."]],[3048,["Shows that you are not only generous, but","you are filled with your compassion."]],[3057,["So this source of compassion which is within","your being, in your heart, you have to just"]],[3066,["open your heart."]],[3068,["If you open that heart, it's like opening","the Sahasrara."]],[3073,["You'll be amazed how you can forgive people","and you can live with them."]],[3080,["I've reports which disturbs Me many a times","that people are forming different groups,"]],[3087,["and having different ashrams, and they don't","come to the collective, and all that."]],[3093,["I feel very much concerned."]],[3095,["Now what is missing is, of course, there are","also some people who think that they must"]],[3101,["have a separate, their own organization, and"]],[3104,["why should they be in the collective, and all that."]],[3107,["So that it is definite, that such a person","has not yet achieved that state of compassion."]],[3119,["In the state of compassion, you like that","somebody tells you that, \"Don't say anything"]],[3132,["to such and such person."]],[3134,["I don't want you to say this.\""]],[3136,["It's very, very joy giving to Me."]],[3140,["Like we had one couple, they were quarrelling","throughout."]],[3145,["They used to send Me letters after letters."]],[3147,["Ah baba, was fed up; telephones after telephones,","both of them quarrelling."]],[3154,["Quarrelling so much, I didn't know what to","do with them."]],[3161,["So, I thought that it's better that they divorce","and finish it off."]],[3167,["And I told them, separately, that, \"You better","divorce each other and get out of it, but"]],[3180,["the complaints you have are such that they","cannot be solved.\""]],[3184,["Said, \"How?\""]],[3185,["I said, \"You are saying that my husband doesn't","give me more time, he is always out, and he"]],[3194,["doesn't spend any nice moments with me, we","don't go out"]],[3199,[" and all these complaints are there."]],[3202,["And the husband says that, she always troubles","me that I must take her out, and I must do"]],[3206,["this, and I must do that."]],[3208,["I want to do it but I can't do it.\""]],[3210,["So I said, \"But when you take a divorce, you'll","never, can claim anything."]],[3215,["Permanently, the husband is lost and you are","lost."]],[3218,["So why do you want to do such a thing?\""]],[3220,["Immediately, know this compassion started","working, and then I put in a word, \"Supposing"]],[3229,["any one of you is sick tomorrow, then who","will look after each other?\""]],[3236,["This just put them out."]],[3238,["You know such little, little moments in life,","come in, in the life of Sahaja Yogis I've"]],[3246,["seen, that suddenly this heart opens, and","with that - they combat all these petty, nonsensical,"]],[3255,["ideas which keeps them out; out of each other","and out of the collectivity."]],[3261,["What gives me the greatest enjoyment is to","see how you love each other, care for each"]],[3269,["other, joke with each other and dance with","each other."]],[3274,["This is the greatest thing that I enjoy."]],[3277,["I don't want to get rid of this idea of Mine."]],[3281,["Despite the fact, so many times I find it's","hard to believe how could Sahaja Yogis behave"]],[3288,["like this, and try to create rifts, and distances","between the people who are realized souls."]],[3299,["Because realized souls anywhere in the world,","you should see them, they respect each other."]],[3307,["Not only respect, cared and never talked ill","of another realized soul."]],[3314,["Never."]],[3315,["I don't know if you have known about the private","lives of these saints."]],[3320,["But in India as we have had so many of them,","when you see them - how they have behaved"]],[3327,["towards each other, the way they have looked","after each other - it's so beautiful; it's"]],[3337,["so noble."]],[3339,["As if they care for the other Sahaja Yogi,","or yogi, or a realized soul, than for themselves."]],[3347,["And the whole thing makes you feel like in","a new world, of new people, who care for the"]],[3361,["feelings of others, and not - what they want","to say, or what they want to have, or they"]],[3367,["are something special."]],[3370,["Also in Sahaja Yoga, you have come; you have","lost your specialities."]],[3378,["Some of them think they're very special."]],[3383,["Supposing I call some lady to put say alta","on My Feet, she starts thinking she is very"]],[3393,["special, but I just call her because I know","she has a horrible agnya and"]],[3398,["I have to clear it out."]],[3405,["And when somebody told Me, \"Mother she thinks","something very special,\" I said, \"Really,"]],[3410,["what makes her think like that?\""]],[3411,["\"Because You call her to put some alta on","Your Feet.\""]],[3416,["I said I just called her that she has such","a horrid, ugly, agnya that she will trouble"]],[3422,["everyone, so I want to clear it."]],[3428,["So, either I should have told her that you","are a very egoistical, horrible and all the"]],[3436,["words that are possible, otherwise she won't","understand."]],[3441,["It's so surprising."]],[3444,["There is one lady who was really very nasty","to her in-laws and everybody in India, and"]],[3452,["she came to see Me."]],[3453,["I called her."]],[3455,["I actually scolded her."]],[3457,["I said, \"What business you had to behave like","this here?"]],[3461,["Your father who was such a racist, you never","said a word against him, and why are you talking"]],[3465,["so much against these people?\""]],[3467,["I scolded her."]],[3468,["She went out and told, \"Oh look at Mother","has called me; nobody is allowed to see Her.\""]],[3474,["I said, \"What's this?\""]],[3478,["It's a very funny situation with people I","sometimes feel the way they think they're"]],[3485,["something special, and they should make themselves","special."]],[3488,["It is becoming really difficult."]],[3491,["Now just to show My love, to appreciate something","people have done, and if you give some present"]],[3504,["to that person, or you show concern about","that person, because he's done some good work"]],[3511,["or something, he starts thinking he's something","special."]],[3516,["I mean is an impossible situation, because","I expect that if I have done anything good"]],[3526,["to that person, or in any way suggested My","concern about a person - that person has to"]],[3534,["become a very good Sahaja Yogi; in the sense","the most humble, and honest, and loving person."]],[3544,["Otherwise it has no meaning."]],[3547,["No use being good to anyone if that means","that person jumps into hell."]],[3555,["So this one is also another idea of speciality,","that they have lost their sense of speciality."]],[3573,["When a drop becomes the ocean, it has become","the ocean, but it's not the drop anymore."]],[3583,["If anybody thinks, \"I am a special person,\"","then know that you are no more an ocean; you"]],[3589,["are still the drop."]],[3591,["Because unless and until you are the drop,","how can you feel that \"I am something special\"?"]],[3598,["So you have lost your speciality."]],[3602,["You have lost it, because all these ideas","of speciality comes from your past."]],[3611,["One lady I met once, long time back, she was","a very rude, proud, arrogant woman."]],[3621,["So this was in Delhi, where people are very","conscious of their husband's jobs, and this"]],[3627,["and that."]],[3629,["I didn't even know the destination, or even","the designation of My husband."]],[3637,["So she was very rude to Me."]],[3641,["I said what's the matter with you, why are","you so rude, what's the problem?"]],[3646,["She said, \"You don't know?"]],[3648,["I'm the wife of such and such.\""]],[3651,["You're the wife or the husband?"]],[3656,["\"I'm the wife of such and such.\""]],[3661,["So she asked Me, \"What are you doing here?\""]],[3665,["I said, \"I am a housewife.\""]],[3671,["Then My husband came."]],[3675,["She said, \"Do you know him?\""]],[3677,["I said, \"Yes I know, why?\""]],[3682,["I thought there must be something wrong there","also."]],[3688,["So she said, \"No I just want to know."]],[3693,["How do you know him?\""]],[3696,["As if I was some criminal or what?"]],[3700,["I said, \"He's My husband.\""]],[3702,["\"Oh my God, he's your husband?\""]],[3706,["What happened?"]],[3707,["As if ten serpents had bitten her."]],[3713,["Maybe, maybe her husband was at a much lower","position than my husband, maybe something"]],[3720,["which I am not conscious of it."]],[3723,["But this is what is \"I'm something special.\""]],[3732,["This stupid idea of being special has to be","completely negated in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3740,["Not mentally."]],[3741,["Not mentally."]],[3742,["Mentally if you're again saying, \"I'm not","special, I'm not special,\" like a mantra,"]],[3754,["you'll become much more."]],[3758,["Because you'll say, \"I've said this mantra","23,000 times."]],[3766,["Who can say like me?\""]],[3774,["So this idea - I'm something special, I'm","something great, I'm something out of the"]],[3780,["blue, something superior to others - just","vanishes."]],[3789,["Like as I said, you are a drop in the sea."]],[3795,["You have become the ocean, but you are no","more a drop, to have any relative value system."]],[3803,["There's no relative value system."]],[3806,["There is no system by which you can say that","I'm higher or he's lower; all that has created"]],[3814,["all the problems of the world."]],[3817,["See from our caste system in India, the social","systems in the West, the racialism in the"]],[3825,["West, also self consciousness of \"my religion","is better, yours is worst, we are the best\""]],[3836,["- all these things have created problems."]],[3839,["It has done no good."]],[3842,["It has failed and failed and failed."]],[3844,["So in Sahaja Yoga at least don't bring this","disease anymore - that, \"I'm better, we, our"]],[3852,["country's better...\""]],[3855,["This speciality you should drop, and real","beauty of your personality will show."]],[3864,["For that you don't need a special scale, you","don't need a special body, you don't need"]],[3871,["a special, what you can call, a glamorous","look."]],[3876,["What you need is a beautiful heart."]],[3879,["And I tell you, it's the beautiful heart that","attracts; nothing else."]],[3886,["It's the beautiful heart that you want to","have."]],[3889,["I've known people nay many like that."]],[3895,["There was one gentleman who divorced his first","wife."]],[3899,["She maybe not be so good looking, maybe ugly,","or whatever it was."]],[3903,["Then he married another good-looking woman,","and he ran away from the house."]],[3910,["So I asked him why."]],[3912,["You didn't like that woman because she was","ugly or whatever it was, so why have you now"]],[3917,["running away from this one?"]],[3919,["\"She has no heart."]],[3923,["She has no heart.\""]],[3927,["And this is what you have - a very great,","generous, beautiful, dharmic heart."]],[3936,["You have got it as a present from the Divine,","and which you must respect."]],[3945,["Should be proud of it, and enjoy it, as you","should enjoy your generosity."]],[3956,["You should enjoy the way all this nature is","enjoying itself."]],[3964,["To be very meticulous about things, to be","all the time correcting others, is a headache."]],[3971,["It's a headache."]],[3974,["The best thing is to correct yourself, and","laugh at yourself; that's the best way you"]],[3979,["can do it."]],[3980,["Everybody has some funny things about themselves."]],[3985,["I also have; I must confess."]],[3989,["And I enjoy them because I think I try and","try, but always I forget."]],[3995,["For example spectacles, I always forget them."]],[3998,["Before coming see I must always forget it."]],[4002,["I tell Myself that I need it, I should take","it, must remember; but invariably I forget,"]],[4008,["and I don't know why."]],[4012,["I, I, I can't do without it, but still I forget."]],[4016,["There's so many things."]],[4018,["For example, I don't know how to count money."]],[4021,["If you may give me 100 rupees, I'll count","it 200 rupees."]],[4026,["I tell you I, I'm good at mathematics, but","I can't count."]],[4030,["I don't know how to sign a check; can you","believe it?"]],[4033,["I can't sign."]],[4034,["You have to write the check for Me, otherwise","I can't."]],[4038,["And somebody asks Me say for say 100 rupees;","I'll give him a big 500 and forget about it."]],[4046,["And that person says, \"Mother You gave me","500.\""]],[4049,["No, no, no, I gave you 100 only."]],[4050,["\"No, You gave me 500.\""]],[4052,["I went home and found out."]],[4054,["It's all right."]],[4055,["After all, if he's dishonest - he's dishonest;","if he's honest - he's honest."]],[4060,["So why to worry about how much money you gave,","and this thing, that thing, meticulously you"]],[4066,["see, finding everything like this?"]],[4068,["And I've seen with all these meticulous people,","they always fail."]],[4073,["Because you see this brain plays some tricks","on them."]],[4076,["For example, there was one fellow who told","Me that,"]],[4080,[" \"The size of your car is such and such.\""]],[4083,["All right then."]],[4084,["\"So the size of the garage will be such and","such.\""]],[4088,["I said all right."]],[4090,["So, when we build the garage, the car won't","get in."]],[4099,["I said such a meticulous architect, and such","a well-known person who has got so many awards,"]],[4107,["this, that - how could he make such a mistake?"]],[4110,["But I still didn't understand it you see."]],[4113,["Now he said, \"Now you better buy a smaller","car.\""]],[4121,["I said at least now you measure this garage","in a proper way, otherwise again if I buy"]],[4127,["something it won't enter in."]],[4130,["So you see what I'm saying, we are so particular,","so meticulous."]],[4135,["Now see these little, little flowers I see","them here; they're not meticulous."]],[4139,["They are growing on their own freely, everybody","gets the sun's rays, and they're quite happy."]],[4146,["But the way we are particular, those people","are very particular, are headaches to themselves."]],[4153,["And then ultimately they find that it's not","so."]],[4156,["You have lost that; you have lost that meticulousness."]],[4159,["I know of a Sahaj Yogini; she was running","a shop, and she said, \"Mother I knew each"]],[4165,["and everything, and I knew each and every","price, and everything I knew in this shop,"]],[4169,["but since I've got realization; I've forgotten","everything.\""]],[4174,["So are you happy or unhappy?"]],[4176,["\"I'm very happy.\""]],[4178,["Why?"]],[4179,["\"Because now I'm making a big profit.\""]],[4182,["Profit is the main thing."]],[4184,["Why should you try to remember each and every","thing?"]],[4187,["So it is to be very meticulous, to be very","systematic, very, world is, if you see around"]],[4196,["- no tree is systematic."]],[4197,["It is unsystematically systematic."]],[4201,["Some leaves are this side, some are that side;","some branches are on that side."]],[4207,["There's no system, because then you become","a military, if you form a system."]],[4214,["So in Sahaja Yoga there is no system."]],[4216,["We are beyond time."]],[4219,["We are beyond all kinds of systems; we have","no system."]],[4224,["All of our system is, \"What is the unigion","within ourselves?\""]],[4229,["Like these two hands, they have no system","built in nothing, but they move."]],[4236,["Especially Italy if you want, both the hands","move like that all the time in Italy."]],[4242,["And I don't know what it means, but they all","do the same thing."]],[4248,["There's no system built in."]],[4250,["Nobody said them that do these gestures and","all that."]],[4253,["But they do it, and do it naturally, all of","them together - without any system."]],[4259,["So to build up mental systems is wrong and","against Sahaja Yoga."]],[4267,["Some people have written to Me, \"Mother we","want to translate your transcriptions, do"]],[4272,["this, do that\" and plans."]],[4273,["I said forget it."]],[4274,["Forget."]],[4278,["Because if you start planning you see, you","will definitely, definitely fall into the"]],[4283,["trap of systems."]],[4287,["You'll have to follow systems; this system","is good, that system is good."]],[4291,["Why not have this way?"]],[4293,["And because I don't, I don't say that it's","wrong, because you have been used to systems."]],[4299,["Especially in the West people have over systematic,","over systematic, in everything."]],[4307,["Like they'll have courses you see built up,","then the spoons, then the forks, then the"]],[4314,["how to move, and what to eat, and how to eat."]],[4319,["I mean it is too much."]],[4321,["If you have to eat food, it's straightforward;","you can eat it with your hands."]],[4327,["No system needed."]],[4329,["For all these systems and norms are too much","in the West, and you should really try to"]],[4336,["them curb down."]],[4338,["As a result they had anti-culture and all","that nonsense; another kind of stupidity where"]],[4345,["they were building up another kind of a system."]],[4348,["See then they said, \"We are hippies now.\""]],[4351,["All right."]],[4352,["So they must have hair never washed, never","clean with lice in their heads, and must be"]],[4358,["all like, you can say, the shankara style","you see."]],[4365,["So all of them have to have that."]],[4368,["Again system."]],[4371,["There's no variety; one hippie means another","the same."]],[4374,["You cannot make them out one from another."]],[4377,["If somebody puts say a ring here - everybody","will put."]],[4380,["If he puts a ring here - everybody will put;","without any brains, without any understanding."]],[4387,["And they talk of individuality; of personality","-where is the individuality?"]],[4393,["There's no individuality, because you take","to anything that your gang, you can call,"]],[4401,["or you can call the crowds that take it, very","fashionable."]],[4408,["In India if you say if it is very fashionable,","it means it is very expensive, and very beautiful"]],[4416,["and is, I mean is very elite, elite word."]],[4423,["But when I said, \"This is very fashionable,\"","means everybody likes it."]],[4428,["It could be punky thing or anything, it's","fashionable."]],[4432,["Finished."]],[4433,["It's the fashion."]],[4435,["Means you do not have your own idea, your","own personality, your own individuality."]],[4443,["In Sahaja Yoga, you too are not bound to any","fashion, no fashion."]],[4451,["If like; wear this, wear that, whatever you","like."]],[4455,["If you fit do what you like, you can wear","whatever you like, but you, as I said again"]],[4462,["that you will govern yourself, you'll be your","own guru, you'll be your own master, and you'll"]],[4467,["do whatever is good, whatever is decent, whatever","the Deities will like, will just do it that"]],[4476,["way because now you are a Sahaja Yogi."]],[4480,["So the life becomes so much easier, so much","easier."]],[4484,["You don't worry about things which are not","there, and you are not also worried about"]],[4490,["the things which are there."]],[4492,["Because you think now, you see something,","all right I have got these knives now; I must"]],[4498,["keep this one for somebody."]],[4502,["I must give it to someone."]],[4504,["So I got a ring which was quite big."]],[4507,["Was thinking whom should I give this; who","has got thick fingers?"]],[4511,["So I started looking at the fingers of everyone","you see, whosoever has a thick finger I'll"]],[4517,["give him this one."]],[4518,["I mean the thought was just the other way","around."]],[4521,["Supposing you are not a Sahaja Yogi then you'll","say, \"Oh Ma, such a big thick finger, why"]],[4526,["not take out some gold and use it, sell it","off?\""]],[4529,["Or else you see, \"You can take out the stone","from here.\""]],[4536,["I mean all kinds of nonsensical things you'll","think, but you'll not think that you better"]],[4541,["give it to somebody because you can't wear","it; it's too big for you."]],[4544,["Why not give it to other?"]],[4546,["What's wrong?"]],[4548,["After all, it is not fitting you, so give","it to other."]],[4552,["But this is only possible in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4555,["I've seen people, very kind, very, very kind","people who have been very sweet to each other"]],[4566,["and exactly what the other person wants, they'll","buy and give it to that person."]],[4573,["Or may say, oh no I have one, I'll give it","to you."]],[4577,["They do it like that."]],[4580,["It's all the time thinking about others."]],[4583,["What should I give?"]],[4585,["What should I do?"]],[4588,["It's the expression of that joy, the compassion","within you."]],[4592,["You use your matter for that, all the time,","all the time."]],[4598,["Like somebody's house was burgled in Canada."]],[4603,["So she writes to Me, \"Thank God my house is","cleaned out now, I didn't know what to do"]],[4608,["with it - the junk\"."]],[4610,["So you see this kind of an attitude comes","in that if you have to do, give to someone,"]],[4616,["then give it to someone who is a Sahaja Yogi","to express your love."]],[4623,["But normally people will do whatever is the","junk in the house, you see whatever is rotten,"]],[4628,["finished, that they will give as a present."]],[4631,["But when you are a Sahaja Yogi you want to","give something really very special, because"]],[4637,["the whole being has become so beautiful - just","like a flower I should say which wants to"]],[4645,["give fragrance to others; all the time the","fragrance of your compassion and love, affection"]],[4651,["and security."]],[4654,["It's a new age, that what they say, but I","would say it's a new human beings that are"]],[4665,["before Me."]],[4666,["And all this newness has so many beautiful","facets that they really sparkle like diamonds,"]],[4674,["no doubt about it."]],[4678,["My only blessings to you is that you grow","in it and grow in it and become greater and"]],[4691,["greater people; never thinking that you are","better than others; never thinking that you"]],[4698,["are special than others."]],[4700,["This will definitely soothe you down completely."]],[4704,["Somebody might have hurt you somewhere, doesn't","matter."]],[4707,["Somebody must have scolded you, doesn't matter."]],[4709,["What is your capacity is to - love another","person, and to be affectionate and kind."]],[4718,["I'm really amazed how these 25 years have","passed with all kinds of stupid problems,"]],[4728,["and nice things and - such a mixture."]],[4731,["And all those things have never disturbed","Me; I was never disturbed."]],[4738,["I used to act sometimes that I am angry, or","sometimes I used to say things which I should"]],[4744,["not have normally said, because it was needed","to be said."]],[4749,["But, on the whole, like sitting in a very","big ship you can say, we all are elevated"]],[4762,["into the realm of Divine Love."]],[4766,["And this is what one has to enjoy."]],[4769,["One person if he has that love and compassion,","and that pure love, then that person can emit"]],[4778,["it to others, and the record of this compassion","is extremely beautiful; which cannot be described"]],[4787,["in words."]],[4788,["Like yesterday I couldn't speak."]],[4791,["In what words I could put My feelings?"]],[4795,["I thought there are no words yet created on","this earth to express My deep feeling that"]],[4805,["how you people have taken Sahaja Yoga so well","and have understood it."]],[4812,["May God bless you all."]],[4831,["Sahasrara Puja is a short one."]],[4836,["We don't have a very long puja for Sahasrara,","because you know Sahasrara breaks in no time."]],[4845,["So it's not a very long puja, but it's very","deep, and again ultimately the last chakra"]],[4855,["which is opened out is here, is the heart."]],[4859,["So in the Sahasrara Puja our hearts open out,","that's the main thing, and that is what one"]],[4867,["has to enjoy, opening of your heart."]],[4871,["Don't worry about any Deities, about any rituals,","any this and that, but just open your heart."]],[4880,["We are not bound by anything; just open your","heart."]]]);
